<main class="page-main info-page">
  <header class="category-hero">
    <h1>FAQ</h1>
    <p class="category-description">
      Quick answers to how this shop experience is intended to work.
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="coming-soon">
    <h2 style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Frequently asked questions</h2>

    <h3>Do you really sell crystals?</h3>
    <p>
      RockBay is set up like a real store, but it’s currently a class project.
      You can browse, add items to your cart, and walk through checkout, but no
      payment is taken and no items are shipped.
    </p>

    <h3>Why does the cart and login still work?</h3>
    <p>
      The cart and account system are there to demonstrate how a real e-commerce
      site could manage users and saved carts using sessions and a database.
    </p>

    <h3>Can I reuse this layout or code?</h3>
    <p>
      Yes. You’re welcome to adapt the general structure, styling, and ideas
      for your own personal projects or portfolios.
    </p>

    <h3>Are the crystal descriptions “official” meanings?</h3>
    <p>
      No. Descriptions are written in the style of crystal shops and are for
      educational/demo purposes only.
    </p>
  </section>
</main>
